{"4813930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"MOBA Manager","steam_appid":4813930,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a team from local leagues to World Championship glory.<\/h2><br>You're the manager. Build the roster, sign sponsors, balance the books, then watch full matches play out in tower-by-tower detail. Every player has a story — your signing today becomes next year's Worlds MVP, or busts, or gets poached by a richer team in free agency. Every decision counts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The deepest simulation engine to date.<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tick-based match engine<\/strong> — 6,800 lines of MOBA simulation: tower destruction, dragon stacks, baron timings, individual player KDA, the works. Every match is a real game, not a coin flip.<br><\/li><li><strong>Pick &amp; ban that matters<\/strong> — champion synergy, counters, early\/mid\/late meta ratings. Your draft strategy actually shapes the match.<br><\/li><li><strong>Multi-league seasons<\/strong> — manage in Europe, North America, Korea, China, or any combination of countries and leagues. International competitions stack on top, you can qualify and play through the gauntlet.<br><\/li><li><strong>Real finances<\/strong> — sponsor negotiations, prize pools, wage bills, fans dictating your income. Lead your team to financial success or economic ruin.<br><\/li><li><strong>Custom rosters<\/strong> — import your own real databases. Uniquely compatible with other similar games supporting JSON.<br><\/li><li><strong>Hall of Fame &amp; team history<\/strong> — your team has a story across decades. Legends get inducted. Trophies fill the cabinet. Important players become club icons.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why MOBA Manager?<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>No yearly re-releases.<\/strong> A constantly improving game that continues to receive updates by a passionate solo developer.<br><\/li><li><strong>Playable fully offline.<\/strong> Offline-ready, saves on disk, no servers to go down.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre roots<\/h2><br>If you've ever lost a weekend to Football Manager, Out of the Park Baseball, or Eastside Hockey Manager — this is that, but for MOBA esports. Built by a fan of the genre for fans of the genre.<br><br><br><br><i>MOBA Manager is a modernized port of the open-source MobaGM Legacy engine by dumbmatter, licensed under Apache 2.0.<\/i>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a team from local leagues to World Championship glory.<\/h2><br>You're the manager. Build the roster, sign sponsors, balance the books, then watch full matches play out in tower-by-tower detail. Every player has a story — your signing today becomes next year's Worlds MVP, or busts, or gets poached by a richer team in free agency. Every decision counts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The deepest simulation engine to date.<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Tick-based match engine<\/strong> — 6,800 lines of MOBA simulation: tower destruction, dragon stacks, baron timings, individual player KDA, the works. Every match is a real game, not a coin flip.<br><\/li><li><strong>Pick &amp; ban that matters<\/strong> — champion synergy, counters, early\/mid\/late meta ratings. Your draft strategy actually shapes the match.<br><\/li><li><strong>Multi-league seasons<\/strong> — manage in Europe, North America, Korea, China, or any combination of countries and leagues. International competitions stack on top, you can qualify and play through the gauntlet.<br><\/li><li><strong>Real finances<\/strong> — sponsor negotiations, prize pools, wage bills, fans dictating your income. Lead your team to financial success or economic ruin.<br><\/li><li><strong>Custom rosters<\/strong> — import your own real databases. Uniquely compatible with other similar games supporting JSON.<br><\/li><li><strong>Hall of Fame &amp; team history<\/strong> — your team has a story across decades. Legends get inducted. Trophies fill the cabinet. Important players become club icons.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why MOBA Manager?<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>No yearly re-releases.<\/strong> A constantly improving game that continues to receive updates by a passionate solo developer.<br><\/li><li><strong>Playable fully offline.<\/strong> Offline-ready, saves on disk, no servers to go down.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre roots<\/h2><br>If you've ever lost a weekend to Football Manager, Out of the Park Baseball, or Eastside Hockey Manager — this is that, but for MOBA esports. Built by a fan of the genre for fans of the genre.<br><br><br><br><i>MOBA Manager is a modernized port of the open-source MobaGM Legacy engine by dumbmatter, licensed under Apache 2.0.<\/i>","short_description":"A deep MOBA esports management sim. You're the manager: scout talent, build the roster, manage finances and watch every match play out in real tower-by-tower detail. From local leagues to the World Championship, it's entirely your journey.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/6dff1590e2d561836832c2caf8310990bc3e9d00\/header.jpg?t=1793694382","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/a4cead96eeb5c4fbea240808588437b1f01bf99c\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793694382","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/a4cead96eeb5c4fbea240808588437b1f01bf99c\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793694382","website":"https:\/\/alagesia.dev\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated Graphics Card<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Alagesia"],"publishers":["Alagesia"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":77,"description":"Touch Only Option"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/9b0492c2bde195e2c666c4c7492d1b061af5096e\/ss_9b0492c2bde195e2c666c4c7492d1b061af5096e.600x338.jpg?t=1793694382","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/9b0492c2bde195e2c666c4c7492d1b061af5096e\/ss_9b0492c2bde195e2c666c4c7492d1b061af5096e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793694382"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/057058d7f99ff32e8118716995188358bc475975\/ss_057058d7f99ff32e8118716995188358bc475975.600x338.jpg?t=1793694382","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/057058d7f99ff32e8118716995188358bc475975\/ss_057058d7f99ff32e8118716995188358bc475975.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793694382"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/438e3fdf7e3ad60dc4c3c182ab7bed2f51caabe2\/ss_438e3fdf7e3ad60dc4c3c182ab7bed2f51caabe2.600x338.jpg?t=1793694382","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4813930\/438e3fdf7e3ad60dc4c3c182ab7bed2f51caabe2\/ss_438e3fdf7e3ad60dc4c3c182ab7bed2f51caabe2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793694382"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\